{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Panic is the world\u2019s least realistic pool simulator. Play as a mischievous, and dare we say, oblivious cue ball in a giant game of pool that sprawls across a colorful cartoon overworld with more than 100 levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore jungles, deserts, carnivals, cities and more while knocking around a peculiar cast of billiard balls, most of which won\u2019t appreciate being pocketed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Pool Panic plays best with a controller </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every level of Pool Panic has an 8-ball, but he won't be standing around waiting to be potted. While you seek him out, you'll be occupied by plenty of strange activities involving balls: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a Ferris Wheel! Knock off other balls for your own gain! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves where even the bats are balls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play nine holes of mini-golf with a pool cue! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee the zombie horde! But careful, they're contagious! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go skiing and mountain climbing! With balls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt boy scouts in the woods! Steal their hats! Wait...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful overworld with more than 100 levels. Shoot pool in deserts, gardens, cities, the carnival, the woods, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get mad at balls that dash away from you, think strategically about when to hit toothy balls that can unleash stomp attacks, and line up the perfect shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down bosses and join a motorcycle gang chase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher levels of the central tower as you travel the world. What awaits you at the top?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to four of your friends in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats. This game has hats.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It Was An Accident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/27bab35ef8b5c19bc540b8b4473c96cd77049cc3.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Panic!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/8eb8807aea411f9d22c80c83b06a0c85f7a536e8.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/76a6e43538ad09214ee43b84a45a1e7626cadd7c.jpg"},{"name":"Ski Sunday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/89652bea1190530d6f6741ee67b1ce473aacc4ab.jpg"},{"name":"Four Minute Mile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/975327c6b63a297216ba48d8579b744ff6235aec.jpg"},{"name":"Touch The Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/11df75320ebde7a1eb41dafba601959d7d90176b.jpg"},{"name":"We All Scream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/05bba71dd9a7c5f5a12be148d3987615f3a7ae08.jpg"},{"name":"I've Got Layers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/13aab3a57d1af312a597d59bdb3dd3169cf4994d.jpg"},{"name":"Pest Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/bc2ce901ef52d020ca6f9380703a0eb28aa8cb06.jpg"},{"name":"A Proclivity For Hat Thievery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/522240/e883e275a08205fc00ee59b3869542e1fdcb4eab.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/522240?t=1739224797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739224797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739224797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739224797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Cue More Chaos Update</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>local co-op mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We cracked open the hood and tipped in 3 more cue balls to Pool Panic\u2019s Story mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/38f151aad16404c619a4f9be93ef965c.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/38f151aad16404c619a4f9be93ef965c.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/38f151aad16404c619a4f9be93ef965c.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now access<strong> local co-op mode</strong> from the pause menu on the world map. Adding from 2 ( sublime ) to 4 ( absolute chaos ) players to the mix. Smash a JCB with friends. Halt a wedding with friends. Ski with friends (as a weird combined omniball). And of course, if you have opened up Panic Mode, Panic with friends to your heart's content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/e148d1e1166bc1029d129004a1013b34.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=307 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/e148d1e1166bc1029d129004a1013b34.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 New VS Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also added <strong>2 shiny new VS rounds</strong> joining the original line up. Motor cycling mayhem and last ball standing melting candles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magnetic Hole Assist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who want things less precise. We\u2019ve added per player Magnetic Hole Assist options to the Control Settings screen. Making shots easier, by pulling rolling balls towards the holes. The ideal help for younger players, decreasing the need for shot accuracy. Or just a way to smash through the levels for some more casual arcadey fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/0c669921399dbefd1dea5e4a56b7f7fb.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=318 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/0c669921399dbefd1dea5e4a56b7f7fb.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/0c669921399dbefd1dea5e4a56b7f7fb.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/15f3447bbb67070382036a408465437e.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool Panic is the world\u2019s least realistic pool simulator. Play as a mischievous, and dare we say, oblivious cue ball in a giant game of pool that sprawls across a colorful cartoon overworld with more than 100 levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore jungles, deserts, carnivals, cities and more while knocking around a peculiar cast of billiard balls, most of which won\u2019t appreciate being pocketed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Pool Panic plays best with a controller </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/62cafc944f87b35a959b2739cccc9574.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every level of Pool Panic has an 8-ball, but he won't be standing around waiting to be potted. While you seek him out, you'll be occupied by plenty of strange activities involving balls: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a Ferris Wheel! Knock off other balls for your own gain! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves where even the bats are balls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play nine holes of mini-golf with a pool cue! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee the zombie horde! But careful, they're contagious! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go skiing and mountain climbing! With balls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt boy scouts in the woods! Steal their hats! Wait...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.poster.avif?t=1739224797\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.webm?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522240/extras/a2760099b6ff57a3e502923cb3ff2b6b.mp4?t=1739224797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful overworld with more than 100 levels. Shoot pool in deserts, gardens, cities, the carnival, the woods, and more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get mad at balls that dash away from you, think strategically about when to hit toothy balls that can unleash stomp attacks, and line up the perfect shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down bosses and join a motorcycle gang chase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher levels of the central tower as you travel the world. What awaits you at the top?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to four of your friends in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats. This game has hats.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rekim"],"genres":[{"description":